        }
      ],
      "message": "seeds: drop 21.ninja as a seed source\n\nThe seeds.txt.gz file was last generated on 2026-05-22 (as per the\ncomment in the first line and the most recent entry). This is about\n6 months old now, and probably 10 months when used for the next release.\nThere is no point in feeding (mostly) stale addresses into makeseeds.py\nand keeping the domain around just risks someone else getting access to\nthe host or the domain to insert malicious or fake addresses into it.\n\nMy understanding is that the owner of 21.ninja stepped away from Bitcoin\ndevelopment and probably will not maintain the seeder going forward. I'm\nreaching out to them directly and ping them in a comment below. Happy to\nclose this if they come back and plan to keep maintaining the seeds.",
